    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7865" root="حزق" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَزِيقَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِزْقٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِزْقَةٌ</span></b> ,
(TA,) <i>A part,</i> or <i>portion,</i> (K, TA,) [of a swarm]
of locusts; (TA;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِرْقَةٌ</span>; (K and TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خرق</span>;) or of anything; (K, TA;) even of
wind: (TA:) pl. of the former <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَزَائِقُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُزُقٌ</span>
(K, TA [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِزَقٌ</span>, which is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِزْقَةٌ</span>,])
and [coll. gen. n.] ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَزِيقٌ</span></b> . (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدِيقَةٌ</span> [<i>A walled garden;</i> &amp;c.]: (K:) or the
<i>like of a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حديقة</span> (Ibn-'Abbád, TA.)


